  "fullDescription": "Retro Groove is a bold and funky display font inspired by 70s retro aesthetics, psychedelic posters, and groovy lettering. With its chunky curves, bubbly shapes, and vintage vibes, this font adds a playful, nostalgic feel to any design.\n\nWhether you’re creating t-shirt designs, logos, album covers, retro posters, or branding projects, Retro Groove brings a blast from the past with a modern twist. It’s perfect for projects that need a fun, hand-drawn, and vibrant look!\n\nThis font is handcrafted and full of personality — ideal for funky headlines, bold quotes, children’s books, summer stickers, disco party invites, and more.\n\nIdeal For:\nRetro & vintage designs\n70s style branding\nGroovy t-shirt prints\nPrint on demand\nFunky product packaging\nComics\nBold logo design\nPosters, flyers & stickers\nChildren’s design and fun invitations",
